    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "self compassion doesn't really fix the fact that i've ruined everything. everyone's gonna see me as a joke. i just keep thinking about how much easier it'd be if i didn't have to face the morning. if i didn't have to see the look on their faces or deal with the lawyers and the debt. i just want the descent to stop. it feels like there's no way to land without being completely destroyed.",
